{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886820/extras/873fb5bba7fe858c3ba3030caf61916c.poster.avif?t=1759787579\" width=544 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886820/extras/873fb5bba7fe858c3ba3030caf61916c.webm?t=1759787579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886820/extras/873fb5bba7fe858c3ba3030caf61916c.mp4?t=1759787579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Sunflowers</strong> is an app for gamers who like to achieve goals and finish what they started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main mission is to complete 100 games from the Steam library and complete all the achievements in each of them. For each fully completed game, you open one of 100 sunflowers inside the app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link to the Steam library</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress tracker for selected games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress by Game Series</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement Points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement Analysis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 achievements inside the app - one for each game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual progress towards your main goal - 100% completion of 100 games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is not just a list - this is your personal challenge and collection of victories. Can you collect all 100 sunflowers?</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3886820?t=1759787579","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886820/4227deb37f54784a55bd8218c7972524ecbd4df6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759787579","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886820/d20d54279eceae6cfc0caf8651b63fd46ca416c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759787579","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886820/d20d54279eceae6cfc0caf8651b63fd46ca416c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759787579","categories":[{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886820/extras/873fb5bba7fe858c3ba3030caf61916c.poster.avif?t=1759787579\" width=544 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886820/extras/873fb5bba7fe858c3ba3030caf61916c.webm?t=1759787579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886820/extras/873fb5bba7fe858c3ba3030caf61916c.mp4?t=1759787579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100 Sunflowers</strong> is an app for gamers who like to achieve goals and finish what they started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main mission is to complete 100 games from the Steam library and complete all the achievements in each of them. For each fully completed game, you open one of 100 sunflowers inside the app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link to the Steam library</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress tracker for selected games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress by Game Series</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement Points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievement Analysis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100 achievements inside the app - one for each game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual progress towards your main goal - 100% completion of 100 games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is not just a list - this is your personal challenge and collection of victories. Can you collect all 100 sunflowers?</i></p>","developers":["Maksim Chingin"],"genres":[{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886820/0a40787cba4f9e4cdf4c01a8302dcb9d4ec2da66/header.jpg?t=1759787579","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3886820/2091870005/dc0a338cf9faefed2c204e2d6af887ee2d89b65a/1758472594/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758474674","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3886820/2091870005/dc0a338cf9faefed2c204e2d6af887ee2d89b65a/1758472594/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758474674","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3886820/2091870005/dc0a338cf9faefed2c204e2d6af887ee2d89b65a/1758472594/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758474674","id":257203395,"name":"100Sunflowers","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257203395/49d503ce742845bae794e635c427e691a974b9f4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758474674"}],"name":"100 Sunflowers","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 800 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Any<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5